  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/04/P1560391.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Ribesalbes ha adelantado la Pascua por segundo a&ntilde;o consecutivo y ha celebrado las paellas en jueves santo, al ser nuevamente festivo.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/04/P1560452.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Con perfecta organizaci&oacute;n de la Comisi&oacute;n de Fiestas, en el Local Sociocultural ha actuado el grupo ondense de flamenquito Sent&iacute;o.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/correctapaellesribesalbes2017/p1560390.jpg\" alt=\"p1560390\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/correctapaellesribesalbes2017/p1560391.jpg\" alt=\"p1560391\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/correctapaellesribesalbes2017/p1560392.jpg\" alt=\"p1560392\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/correctapaellesribesalbes2017/p1560393.jpg\" alt=\"p1560393\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/correctapaellesribesalbes2017/p1560396.jpg\" alt=\"p1560396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/correctapaellesribesalbes2017/p1560398.jpg\" alt=\"p1560398\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/correctapaellesribesalbes2017/p1560399.jpg\" alt=\"p1560399\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/correctapaellesribesalbes2017/p1560400.jpg\" alt=\"p1560400\" style=\"max-width:10